## Authority profile

**Path:** `/authority/facts/profile/PROFILE.md`

Prose facts about the user, by discipline. Not project design.

**When to read**

Only when **HANDOFF** (or explicit user message) instructs you to — typically at boot. Do not load by default; authority exists so agents read **only what they need**.

**How to read (when instructed)**

- **MVP:** read the **full file** unless HANDOFF scopes sections or proficiencies.
- **Later:** HANDOFF may request specific disciplines or proficiency slices only.
- Load **Agent collaboration** when in doubt; other sections on demand.
- Do **not** assume the **work** stack (Java, banking) applies to game/tooling repos unless the task requires it.

**Writes**

Do not edit unless the user requests an update or wrap proposes a promoted patch for approval.
